  "description": "Kokoro offline voice engine for uTPro.Feature.TextToSpeech. Adds natural-sounding English and other Kokoro voices that run fully in-process on your server (ONNX, CPU only, no API key, no outbound traffic after the model is downloaded). Registers itself through the TextToSpeech engine collection, so no edits to the core package or the host Program.cs are needed. Windows and Linux.",
