  "releaseNotes": "v17.0.1 / v18.0.1: Package title cleanup - the NuGet package title no longer carries the \"for Umbraco N\" suffix (the add-on keeps its descriptive name). No functional changes. v17.0.0 / v18.0.0: Initial release, shipped as two version lines — 17.x for Umbraco 17 and 18.x for Umbraco 18 — in lockstep with the core TextToSpeech package lines. Kokoro engine for uTPro.Feature.TextToSpeech on KokoroSharp (CPU build): lazy single model instance, background warm-up, speed control.",
